A responsive, local-first DJ interface prototype with selectable **2 Decks / 4 Decks**, a performance mixer, and a searchable music library.

## Run it

Open `index.html` in a recent desktop browser, then choose **Open music** or drag audio files into the library. Music is selected from your device and played locally in the browser; this app has **no YouTube integration** and does not fetch music from online services.

## Included

- 2-deck and 4-deck layouts
- Local audio file picker and drag-and-drop library
- Per-deck play/pause, stop, cue, sync, gain, tempo, and 3-band EQ controls
- Master level, crossfader, cue mix, and A/B filter controls
- Searchable track list and responsive dark blue theme

This is a browser-based prototype. Browser support for audio formats varies, and local files are not uploaded or persisted after the page is closed. The visual waveform is illustrative; it does not analyze audio data.
